(Abstract) Tj T*
(Plant height is a key agronomic trait in rice. We identified a major QTL, qPH7.1, on chromosome) Tj T*
(7 using 180 recombinant inbred lines. qPH7.1 explained 23.5% of the phenotypic variance and was) Tj T*
(significantly associated with plant height in both environments.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Introduction) Tj T*
(Semi-dwarf stature improved lodging resistance in modern rice cultivars. Several plant height) Tj T*
(genes have been cloned, but natural variation in temperate japonica remains poorly) Tj T*
(characterized.) Tj T*
