(Materials and Methods) Tj T*
(A population of 180 recombinant inbred lines was grown at two locations in 2022. Plant height) Tj T*
(was measured at maturity from the soil surface to the tip of the tallest panicle. Genotyping) Tj T*
(used 1,536 SNP markers. QTL analysis was performed with QTL IciMapping version 4.2 using) Tj T*
(inclusive composite interval mapping. Linkage maps were constructed with JoinMap version 5.0.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Results) Tj T*
(Plant height of the parents differed markedly. The mean plant height of the population ranged) Tj T*
(from 85.2 to 132.6 cm.) Tj T*
(Table 2 Plant height of parents in two environments) Tj T*
(Line Env1 Env2) Tj T*
(Parent1 118.4 cm 121.0 cm) Tj T*
(Parent2 92.1 cm 95.3 cm) Tj T*
