(qPH7.1 was located between markers S7_1203 and S7_1377 with a LOD score of 12.8. The allele) Tj T*
(from Parent1 increased plant height by 8.6 cm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Discussion) Tj T*
(qPH7.1 co-localized with a previously reported heading date region, suggesting a possible) Tj T*
(pleiotropic effect that requires validation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Conclusion) Tj T*
(qPH7.1 is a promising target for marker-assisted breeding of plant height in rice.) Tj T*
